# Project intelligence — Shearwater WordPress

- This repo is a custom WordPress theme (`wp-content/themes/shearwater-vf`) plus a static `preview/` of the same design.
- Brand: Shearwater Victoria Falls (since 1984). Public contacts: +263 83 2844471, +263 773 461716, online@shearwatervf.com.
- Do not invent prices. Keep combo rates and legal copy in WP Admin, not hardcoded, except the promo bar (Customizer).
- Preview HTML is generated by `python3 scripts/build-preview.py`. After visual CSS changes, regenerate preview.
- Theme activation seeds pages/menu/experiences once (`shearwater_vf_seeded` option). To re-seed, delete that option.
- Page templates live in `templates/` and are assigned on activation.
- Unsplash URLs in `inc/images.php` are placeholders only.
